# Mensagem esperada de cada tests/terrac/sintaxe_*.terra, sem o número da linha (ver a issue #23).
sintaxe_await: after `await´ : expected event
sintaxe_comando: before `awiat´ : expected statement (not last statement as `return´ or `break´)
sintaxe_end: after `;´ : expected statement (not last statement as `return´ or `break´)
sintaxe_expressao: after `=´ : expected expression
sintaxe_parentese: after `LED0´ : expected `;´
sintaxe_pontoevirgula: after `1´ : expected `;´
sintaxe_then: after `1´ : expected `then´
sintaxe_tipo: after `x´ : expected a not reserved identifier beginning with lower-case
